1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,751
What if gravity flipped every time your phone buzzed?

2
00:00:03,791 --> 00:00:06,824
You are happily eating a sandwich in the park.

3
00:00:06,864 --> 00:00:07,158
Bzzt.

4
00:00:07,198 --> 00:00:09,496
And suddenly, the sky is the floor.

5
00:00:10,650 --> 00:00:12,654
Gravity flips again at the café.

6
00:00:12,694 --> 00:00:14,378
Cups rocket to the ceiling,

7
00:00:14,418 --> 00:00:17,571
chairs follow, and the barista calmly asks whether

8
00:00:17,611 --> 00:00:20,253
anyone wants to keep their oat milk latte.

9
00:00:21,450 --> 00:00:23,287
Then the group chat wakes up.

10
00:00:23,327 --> 00:00:26,134
Twenty-three notifications, each one a flip.

11
00:00:26,174 --> 00:00:27,364
Up, down, up again.

12
00:00:27,404 --> 00:00:30,017
You become a very confused pinball with a

13
00:00:30,057 --> 00:00:31,053
very full inbox.

14
00:00:32,250 --> 00:00:34,202
On the highway it gets worse.

15
00:00:34,242 --> 00:00:36,468
Cars float up like startled fish.

16
00:00:36,508 --> 00:00:39,284
Drivers wave, hold their steering wheels,

17
00:00:39,324 --> 00:00:41,688
and admit that this is a bad moment

18
00:00:41,728 --> 00:00:42,924
to receive a text.

19
00:00:44,150 --> 00:00:45,905
You switch on airplane mode.

20
00:00:45,945 --> 00:00:48,469
Great idea, except everyone else didn't.

21
00:00:48,509 --> 00:00:50,520
So you hug a lamp post while the

22
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:54,110
whole town flips, and ten thousand phones sing together.

23
00:00:55,350 --> 00:00:57,721
Physicists would call this pure fiction,

24
00:00:57,761 --> 00:00:59,890
since a phone cannot change gravity.

25
00:00:59,930 --> 00:01:01,578
But as a thought experiment,

26
00:01:01,618 --> 00:01:04,953
a flipping vector would make every day a roller coaster.

27
00:01:06,150 --> 00:01:07,127
Then the twist.

28
00:01:07,167 --> 00:01:09,162
Your battery hits one percent,

29
00:01:09,202 --> 00:01:10,450
and the phone dies.

30
00:01:10,490 --> 00:01:11,806
Nobody can text you.

31
00:01:11,846 --> 00:01:13,841
Gravity stays flipped forever,

32
00:01:13,881 --> 00:01:16,824
and the whole town is now living on the sky.

33
00:01:18,050 --> 00:01:20,544
So everyone learns to walk on clouds,

34
00:01:20,584 --> 00:01:22,120
plug in their chargers,

35
00:01:22,160 --> 00:01:24,106
and keep their phones nearby.

36
00:01:24,146 --> 00:01:26,777
Now nobody dares to send you a message.

37
00:01:26,817 --> 00:01:28,010
Not even your mum.
